"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_1.png", "id": "961509680375269", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771278_961509683708602_7441023274481223005_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FPYSdG9lunQQ7kNvwEPrcvK&_nc_oc=AdoCPUoIho7RSxn4ku4v1xWOGZoh973-m418NhaxhcvgzZoR25L9TS_A2q4OLc1j1cg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSZjRTTBeSEo3s3fN5qmvpNVlo_E6QpyElO0MPi6PBhEg&oe=6B0DAB58"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2.png", "id": "990972230293610", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771249_990972233626943_5588397222181306042_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Onuw27IhnEkQ7kNvwHLQ2AP&_nc_oc=AdqbhpX7zAIrTXKL1XWxJ3JSZ_MgTUBqG51CWhuTlcI_vMoC5nR_3ch4SucuErQVm88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQReZ-t7FAieHpam9714En7Q-lsgVmc4YmAV3iQD8seUeQ&oe=6B0DC1C9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_3.png", "id": "1044282382025575", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771264_1044282388692241_2768711316271123367_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gj7EE_uyEUcQ7kNvwEW0ahs&_nc_oc=AdqDiV53uX2BlZDDv59EDQ5Yw9YuRuZp-rUCktm_Dfr4IuY-uCN1SXZpdrEcYfuo1uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRtr5mj8j-9R3Px3OzgxMdnibX1_S-Ht7HdL9g4x5a-gA&oe=6B0DA1A0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "3D-Pic Maker", "keywords": ["AI", "3D", "photo", "spatial", "picture"], "long_description": "Your photos were never meant to stay flat. \u2728\n\n3D-Pic Maker turns any picture into a true spatial 3D scene. Lean in, step to the side, peek behind the subject, and the moment opens up around you like a window.\n\n\ud83e\udde0 AI THAT RUNS ON YOUR HEADSET\n\u25b8 Depth Anything 3: state-of-the-art depth for crisp, natural 3D (optional max-quality mode)\n\u25b8 LaMa: repaints what was hidden behind people and objects, so the scene stays whole as you move\n\u25b8 Real-ESRGAN: restores detail and cleans up noise in small or old photos\n\u25b8 \ud83d\udd12 100% private: no cloud, no account, no uploads\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 YOUR PHOTOS, FROM ANYWHERE\n\u25b8 Headset gallery, downloads and screenshots\n\u25b8 Home NAS and Windows shared folders\n\u25b8 Built-in browser: find a picture, tap \"Make 3D\"\n\u25b8 \u2b50 Favorite folders and sites, one click away\n\n\ud83e\udd7d MADE FOR PRESENCE\n\u25b8 Full 6DoF: walk and lean naturally\n\u25b8 Up to 8K textures\n\u25b8 Grab, move and resize photos and menus\n\u25b8 Fine-tune depth, edges and color in a side panel\n\u25b8 Passthrough: bring your memories into your room\n\u25b8 Export side-by-side stereo images\n\n\ud83d\ude80 GETTING STARTED\n1. Open the menu and pick a photo: Device, Network / NAS or Web\n2. Wait a few seconds and the 3D scene appears in front of you\n3. B/Y: menu \u00b7 A: recenter \u00b7 sticks: depth, distance, size \u00b7 grip: move\n\n\ud83d\udca1 The app starts with a fast depth model. For maximum detail, turn on Depth Anything 3 in Menu \u2192 AI Generation \u2192 Depth model. It takes longer per photo.\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 Pick a photo. Wait a few seconds. Step inside.", "short_description": "\u2728 Step inside your photos. 3D-Pic Maker turns any picture into a living 3D scene you can lean into and look around.\n\ud83e\udde0 On-device AI \u00b7 \ud83d\udd12 No cloud, no uploads \u00b7 \ud83e\udd7d Made for Quest 3"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/3d-pic-maker-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CROSS Graphics", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/3d-pic-maker-privacy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"i